      "writtenOn": "2023-12-25T06:53:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The problem with adding NSEC records from `addReplyFromService()` is that multiple NSEC records of the same name will be added in the additional answers section if there are multiple questions for different records of the same service. For example, if there are questions for the TXT and SRV records of a service, two NSEC records of the same name will be added to the answers but this CL can compact them into a single NSEC record.\n\nAnother option is to check if an NSEC record for a given name is already added into the answers and compact the new NSEC record into the existing one if there is. But I think this is just more complex.",
      "parentUuid": "6c267003_3c24f823",
      "revId": "f7f5afddc90b74dc95e8fafaaa709477a2ae0673",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
